{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52069","headline":"五言春日侍宴望海应诏 · 刘洎","name":"五言春日侍宴望海应诏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"巨壑观无际，灵异藴难详。\n寻真游汉武，架石驻秦皇。\n方丈神仙敻，蓬莱道路长。\n俱由肆情慾，非爲恤封壃（同「疆」）。\n何如应顺动，鸣銮事省方。\n徘徊临委输，迢遰极扶桑。\n滔滔四渎府，浩浩百川王。\n浮天还纳汉，浴日乍翻光。\n夷洲暧淑景，有岛丽时芳。\n幸属沧波谧，欣逢宝化昌。\n（《翰林学士集》）（按：此诗原署「侍中清苑县开国男臣刘泊上」，「泊」爲「洎」之误。\n张步云《唐代逸诗辑存》收本诗。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘洎","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52069.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52069","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}